sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant Reconciler as LLMBatchGatewayReconciler
    participant Helm as Helm SDK<br/>(in-process)
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant MetricsSvc as Metrics Endpoint<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over K8s,Helm: Flow 1: LLMBatchGateway Reconciliation
        Admin->>K8s: Create LLMBatchGateway CR
        K8s->>Reconciler: Watch event<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Reconciler->>Helm: Render batch-gateway chart<br/>(in-process, specToHelmValues)
        Helm-->>Reconciler: Rendered manifests
        opt dispatchMode=async
            Reconciler->>Helm: Render async-processor chart
            Helm-->>Reconciler: Async manifests
        end
        Reconciler->>K8s: Server-Side Apply resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>Reconciler: Applied
        Reconciler->>K8s: Patch status conditions<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Reconciler->>K8s: Orphan cleanup (list + delete stale)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over K8s,Reconciler: Flow 2: Cross-Namespace Secret Sync
        Reconciler->>K8s: List ReferenceGrants in secretRef.namespace<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>Reconciler: ReferenceGrant found
        Reconciler->>K8s: Get source Secret<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>Reconciler: Secret data
        Reconciler->>K8s: SSA managed Secret copy<br/>(name: {gw-name}-credentials)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Prom,MetricsSvc: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping
        Prom->>MetricsSvc: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS 8443/TCP<br/>Auth: Bearer token (SA token)
        MetricsSvc->>K8s: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8s-->>MetricsSvc: Authorized
        MetricsSvc-->>Prom: Metrics response
    end
